"id":"euler.lemma-2.4","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 2.4","locator":"Lemma 2.4, Section 2","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 2.4.** Assume (2.7). The scaled components of the wave vector satisfy $$\\begin{equation}\n \\sup|\\zeta-\\zeta_0|\\le CT^C\\delta\\le\\tfrac12,\\qquad\n \\sup\\left|\\frac{|k|^2\\cos^2\\varphi}{\\lambda^2}-1\\right|\n       \\le CT^C\\delta\\le\\tfrac12. \\tag{2.10}\n\\end{equation}$$ In particular $$\\begin{equation}\n \\tfrac12\\le\\zeta_3\\le\\tfrac32,\\qquad |\\zeta|\\le3T^2 . \\tag{2.11}\n\\end{equation}$$ The components $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2$ of every amplitude vector satisfy $$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\binom{\\alpha_1}{\\alpha_2}\n =\\left\\{-\\begin{pmatrix}\n \\varepsilon\\tau\\sin2\\varphi&\\cos^2\\varphi(1-\\varepsilon\\tan\\varphi)\\\\\n 1&0\n \\end{pmatrix}+\\mathcal E(\\tau)\\right\\}\\binom{\\alpha_1}{\\alpha_2},\n \\qquad \\sup|\\mathcal E|\\le CT^C\\delta,$$ where $\\mathcal E$ is the same for all amplitude vectors.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.4","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.4","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.4%22%2C%22euler.lemma-2.2%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.4%22%2C%22euler.lemma-2.2%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.2"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.4","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.4%22%2C%22euler.lemma-2.3